# Docker
docker-compose*.yml
data/

# Tests, docs, and dev tooling — never read by the image build. Excluding them
# keeps test/doc-only changes from invalidating the builder's `COPY . .` layer
# (which would force a full `next build` inside Docker for nothing).
# CHANGELOG.md and version.json must stay in the context: next.config.mjs
# inlines them at build time.
test
docs
benchmark
coverage
scripts
dist
vitest.config.ts
vitest.setup.ts
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
package.tmp.json
.claude
SECURITY.md

# Misc
README.md
.github
